#!bovnar 1.1
# prefixes.bvnr — single source of truth for the SI and IEC prefixes.
#
# HOW THIS WORKS
#   Hand-edited. gen_prefixes.py (at the repo root) regenerates the C prefix
#   tables from this file on every build; never edit the generated
#   *.gen.{h,inc}. To add, remove, or change a prefix, edit a record below and
#   rebuild. Two lists: .si_prefixes and .iec_prefixes.
#
# STABLE IDS (ABI)
#   .id is the si_prefix_id_t / iec_prefix_id_t enum value. Append-only: NEVER
#   renumber or reuse an id. Each list is numbered from 1 (si_quecto.., iec_
#   kibi..); the identity prefixes si_none/iec_none are id 0 and stay in C.
#
# FIELDS (one record per prefix)
#   .id       enum value (stable); the C constant is  si_<name> / iec_<name>
#   .name     enumerator suffix (e.g. "kilo", "kibi")
#   .symbol   canonical OUTPUT symbol, real UTF-8 (e.g. "µ", "Ki")
#   .exp      power of 10 (SI) or power of 2 (IEC); the scale factor is derived
#   .aliases  every accepted INPUT spelling (e.g. micro: ["µ", "u"])

.schema_version = <uint:16> 1;

